This program is a Go game review tool. Its review workflow, analysis formulas,
and screen layout follow ideas from KaTrain:

  https://github.com/sanderland/katrain
  Copyright (c) 2020 Sander Land
  Licensed under the MIT License.

No KaTrain images, sounds, or fonts are included. Board stones, coordinates,
and navigation marks are drawn at runtime. The bundled Noto Sans TC font is
under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.

KataGo (https://github.com/lightvector/KataGo) is a separate program. mykatago
does not ship the KataGo executable or neural-network weights.
